## Development and preview builds

Run `./x dev /path/to/project` from a checkout, or install a published preview
with `npm install -g @intuitums/e@dev` and run `e-dev`. Beta uses `@beta` and
`e-beta`. Curl and brew support separate beta installations; dev uses npm or bun. Preview channels
have separate state and stay on their channel when updating.
See [releases and testing](docs/releases.md) for all installers and PR builds.
